@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #222222
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #D9D9E3
  ParticipantBorderColor #8A8A9A
  ActorBackgroundColor #D9D9E3
  ActorBorderColor #8A8A9A
}

actor User
actor Application
participant Gatekeeper
collections Pool

User -> Application : Authenticates with wallet session
User -> Gatekeeper : Asks about the withdraw (amount, USDC, receiver)
Gatekeeper -> Gatekeeper : Check the auth
Gatekeeper --> User : EIP-712 authorization (audit metadata, signature, application identity)
User -> User : Prove in Web Worker and sign
User -> Pool : Withdraw USDC with proof and authorization
Pool -> Pool : Emit HPKE audit envelope

@enduml
